        <fr:title text="Current workaround">Current workaround</fr:title>
      </fr:frontmatter>
      <fr:mainmatter>
        <html:p>Until this lands, every TODO tree must carry <html:em>both</html:em> forms redundantly:</html:p>
        <html:pre><![CDATA[\tag{status-pending}
\meta{status}{pending}]]></html:pre>
        <html:p>The tag powers Datalog queries; the meta powers the XSL display badge. Dropping either breaks something.</html:p>
      </fr:mainmatter>
